LICENCE PENDING FOUNDER DECISION

The relay server in this folder (`relay/server`, and `relay/worker` if present) has no licence yet.
The founder is choosing between copyleft (AGPL-3.0: open, but a hosted clone must publish its
changes) and proprietary (all rights reserved, closed source, still freely self-hostable as a
binary). Until that decision is recorded here, all rights are reserved and no licence is granted.

The protocol crate (`relay/protocol`) is not covered by this notice: it is MIT-licensed (see
`relay/protocol/LICENSE`), like the Puppet Master app, so any client can speak to any relay.
